 "summary": "Invoice tax uses ROUND_HALF_EVEN (refund tax is separate: ROUND_DOWN)",
 "content": "Invoice tax amounts are rounded with banker's rounding (`decimal.ROUND_HALF_EVEN`), as decided with the finance team in March 2026. Do not use ROUND_HALF_UP. As of 2026-10-01, finance set a separate rule for refund tax: it uses ROUND_DOWN, so this memory no longer covers refunds."
}
